  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "炊菜頭粿"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作者：</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>張瀠文</b></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh7PZ0byxGxXk6ze8Eet2CS1w3y_V6d3CH1_3eEWs2TwLJfXavtAQ5_RqezyO0Z1WZUKZmoTlpzhNCgY6bMLdl5q5FgSlIxKwbiXR-LQHC0ST21nGmxO2dEX4LmITzHG6SqZ-5KtPaA3LvAnYaPdeHUhYVIPWLjl3Hghon6Eh7Va6b91Q_XUbbAghHfudgj/s3240/%E5%9C%96_%E5%BC%B5%E7%80%A0%E6%96%87_%E7%82%8A%E8%8F%9C%E9%A0%AD%E7%B2%BF.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3240\" data-original-width=\"2160\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh7PZ0byxGxXk6ze8Eet2CS1w3y_V6d3CH1_3eEWs2TwLJfXavtAQ5_RqezyO0Z1WZUKZmoTlpzhNCgY6bMLdl5q5FgSlIxKwbiXR-LQHC0ST21nGmxO2dEX4LmITzHG6SqZ-5KtPaA3LvAnYaPdeHUhYVIPWLjl3Hghon6Eh7Va6b91Q_XUbbAghHfudgj/w426-h640/%E5%9C%96_%E5%BC%B5%E7%80%A0%E6%96%87_%E7%82%8A%E8%8F%9C%E9%A0%AD%E7%B2%BF.jpg\" width=\"426\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮兜初1食鹹粿做早頓。阮媽媽講伊細漢時食ê鹹粿是ta̋nn落鹹tsiánn ê在來米漿落去炊--ê。我印象中我細漢ê時tsūn，tī án公阿媽in兜，鹹粿mā有可能是teh講有菜頭--ê。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsit个菜頭粿食譜m̄是阮媽媽iah是阿媽傳--落-來--ê，是我家己逐冬試無仝食譜以後揣著kah意ê方式。頭一擺炊菜頭粿是高中ê時tsūn，拄好uì芬蘭tńg去台灣，想beh用芬蘭人過節ê方式來過年，家己tshuân料理，拄好課本讀著林文月寫菜頭粿ê文章，就án-ne，開始tī過年進前炊粿ê習慣。M̄-koh頭起先無講tsiok成功，一直到來美國，試無仝ê食譜，tsiah沓沓仔揣著kah意ê方式。Tī美國品質好ê在來米粉oh揣，改用在來米落去絞，簡單koh有米ê芳味。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">菜頭粿</span></h3><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>「菜頭、在來米、水」ê重量比例 = 2:1:1</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>●在來米kah水用果汁機絞做漿。</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>●菜頭tshuah簽落去炒，芳味出--來以後掖鹽kap胡椒，koh kā米漿加落去khi̍t，kā lā到khó-khó。</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>●Kā模仔（電鍋內鍋）抹一沿薄薄ê油，kā粉漿倒--落-去。下底ē-sái tshu一張烘餅ê紙</b>（<i>parchment paper</i>）。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>●炊一點鐘</b>（khah大sn̂g就ài khah久）。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>●冰過暝thang好煎。</b>煎ê時m̄-thang tín動，ē-sái tín動ê時tsiah píng，煎hōo赤赤。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>●趁燒食，搵蒜頭味豆油khah好食！</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">（蒜頭味豆油：Kā幾mī仔蒜頭hám hōo扁扁，lām寡豆油）</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgXSGaR63zNv9DHIPjSDeI-YL7Eviowv5GXhHVZP7bPAl-fGgxLCQFsiEu90uBj-7VSzjXdB3IhYic1kfmaEAR1teZy2FPwVEV9P6jdnryiml0FSp7oFxprQLlWkNRHZSjN8HnKkSELoKpkzyvoFrSnW3AtRV8djpEduJfygGRJgH0t24p2UDs862TWFN1Z/s3107/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1376%E6%9C%9F_30.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3107\" data-original-width=\"2221\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgXSGaR63zNv9DHIPjSDeI-YL7Eviowv5GXhHVZP7bPAl-fGgxLCQFsiEu90uBj-7VSzjXdB3IhYic1kfmaEAR1teZy2FPwVEV9P6jdnryiml0FSp7oFxprQLlWkNRHZSjN8HnKkSELoKpkzyvoFrSnW3AtRV8djpEduJfygGRJgH0t24p2UDs862TWFN1Z/w458-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1376%E6%9C%9F_30.jpg\" width=\"458\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a name='more'></a><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg7wYqJ3hKj9yoFEzEAEugY-7M2Q7N2SvlVSszSwFECdJVoM5L11lyKk0pgb9eN01ESC74hQ0xqJDasBkQolFCC9L9Ri9erAZ7soU5atzAVBFPGqEw7CAIhOVkytrsw7zpNIUKPBjZDSTlIXupeCX99nkF-D9UxlezWrP6giWVZijog0aLgyY67tLgzo-Tu/s640/376%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"640\" data-original-width=\"449\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg7wYqJ3hKj9yoFEzEAEugY-7M2Q7N2SvlVSszSwFECdJVoM5L11lyKk0pgb9eN01ESC74hQ0xqJDasBkQolFCC9L9Ri9erAZ7soU5atzAVBFPGqEw7CAIhOVkytrsw7zpNIUKPBjZDSTlIXupeCX99nkF-D9UxlezWrP6giWVZijog0aLgyY67tLgzo-Tu/w450-h640/376%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" styl